{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1438533-fire-touched-can-t-control-fire","id":1438533,"title":"Fire-Touched can't control fire?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-08T00:40:09-08:00","id":1438533,"title":"Fire-Touched can't control fire?","content":"According to the Dark Ages Companion, Fire-Touched have Wisdom, Cunning, and Glory as their Renowns. However, Tongue of Flame from the Elemental Gifts requires Purity. So, are Fire-Touched not actually supposed to be able to Influence fire? Are there more up-to-date rules on making Pure than what's in the Dark Ages Companion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13542-shadowdragon","name":"Shadowdragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-08T03:36:54-08:00","id":1438544,"title":"","content":"Those renowns listed are only the free dot starting ones, each werewolf can purchase each type of the five renowns.<br /> Also, you can find more Pure creating options in the Shunned by the moon book","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-08T03:47:33-08:00","id":1438546,"title":"","content":"The Fire-Touched follow Rabid Wolf, not Fire Wolf. Despite their name, and their love of using fire symbolically, they don't have a specific metaphysical propensity for fire-magic (though as noted, nothing stops them from learning such Gifts).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-08T16:45:49-08:00","id":1438655,"title":"","content":"Ivory Claws don\u2019t actually have claws of ivory, and Hunters in Darkness can hunt during the day. There\u2019s no need to be totally literal with tribe names and how they work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-08T19:51:06-08:00","id":1438670,"title":"","content":"I mean, aren't ivory tusks and claws both made of thick, layered keratin? lol","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-08T20:49:34-08:00","id":1438677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1438533-fire-touched-can-t-control-fire?p=1438670#post1438670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, aren't ivory tusks and claws both made of thick, layered keratin? lol</div> </div> </div> </div>A handy mnemonic: Tusks are teeth and horns are hair! Dentin and keratin are entirely different substances; ivory is mostly the former and claws are made of the latter.<br /> <br /> More likely the Ivory Claws' nomenclature comes aesthetically from their being the most into the Purity part of the Pure's rhetoric \u2014 also, being archetypically the &quot;civilized&quot; face of the Pure (in contrast to the raving zealots of Rabid Wolf or the atavistic monster-kin of Dire Wolf) lends a more figurative &quot;don't get their hands dirty&quot; reading to the Honor-bound scions of Silver Wolf.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"user